  "evidenceNotes": [
    "Default native stdio clients discover roots only after initialized. Valid explicit IDE analysis configurations win and cancel auto requests. Internal epoch0 never consumes positive client epochs. All directory,manifest and membership I/O runs on the existing XRT worker;owner adopts bounded metadata.",
    "Ordinary source edits do not scan directories. Lexical watcher filtering preserves explicit nested roots and catalog-declared projects below ignored directories. Full-result workers validate shared proof identities;owner observes only an atomic invalidation marker before rediscovery. No filesystem polling loop.",
    "Retained immutable requests are bounded to16slots,128KiB each and1MiB known transport bytes;DOM overhead separate. Cancellation,source serial,root revision,explicit configuration,lease and shutdown never return partial stale workspace scope.",
    "Test-only --wrap=xrtDirOpen first opens a real directory then holds its worker. Six stdio cases prove responsiveness,physical idle before source lease,held-lease deferral,latest-root adoption and joined shutdown. The instrumented link variant is never installed.",
    "Retain missing corpus/SDK overlay setup failures,initial fixture compile collision,path separator bug and incorrect fixture path expectation. Resume only206 exact-command bound objects after full-input/header guards;execute152 compiles. Private host and component fixes are freshly recompiled with unchanged public headers. Final fixture is the native-v6 program;earlier broken fixtures are not counted as qualified.",
    "Existing21protocol drivers retain manual-fence semantics with explicit auto opt-out where appropriate;new26cases exercise default automatic mode. Re-run all21drivers,19current ownership cases,55paired GUI suites and47actual IDE modes against final native0.106.",
    "Publish final native-v6 and140-unit rebuilt GUI locally using matched private XGE,backups and verified rollback support. Re-run26installed auto cases and realC/xlang24-frame renders. Preserve all other runtime files,engine,SDK,standalone updater,metadata and usertmp. No online publication.",
    "Historical raw source bytes and paths remain preserved. LF/CRLF conversions are explicit;final source/full-header/object/link identity guards pass. The localIdeLspRuntime property and one ignore exception are updated independently of unrelated shared-file edits."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Formal performance,RSS/endurance,Linux,sanitizer and physicalWindows7 acceptance remain open. The64-role catalog and bounded discovery limits are unchanged;large-workspace incremental discovery,shared source capture,editing tail latency and remaining applicable LSP features continue.",
    "External service only;no xlc.dll merge,engine rebuild,DAP,debug or runtime completion. Display0.6.2/update iteration and online channel are unchanged. Whole long-term goal remains active."
  ],
